WEBVTT

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.290
<b>What are we up against?</b>

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:22.620
<b>We've spotted four kinds of banners.</b>

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.430
<b>They bear a horse, a dragon, 
a half-moon, and a spear, respectively.</b>

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.880
<b>They fortified every inch of the hill.</b>

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.880
<b>We can see the sun reflecting off rows of spears.</b>

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.260
<b>It feels as if we're up against a small stronghold.</b>

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.770
<b>When our soldiers get too close, 
they are showered with rocks and arrows.</b>

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.940
<b>Were there any casualties?</b>

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:45.770
<b>No.</b>

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:47.860
<b>Luckily, most of the enemy's shots missed.</b>

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.900
<b>Good work.</b>

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.990
<b>How does the small hill look? 
The one farther away.</b>

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:57.620
<b>It's blanketed in snow. 
White through and through.</b>

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.740
<b>There's no sign of the enemy on it.</b>

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:01.240
<b>We've almost caught up with the slaves.</b>

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:03.160
<b>Hurry up.</b>

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:06.250
<b>Take them back so we can hold them as hostages.</b>

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:10.000
<b>War maiden, I'm looking forward to your next move.</b>

