00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.050
<b>Chivalric orders?</b>

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:46.560
<b>A total of five thousand knights?</b>

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:54.480
<b>No matter. At the end of the day, they're only five thousand.</b>

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.900
<b>The fourth division should've arrived by now.</b>

00:11:56.900 --> 00:12:00.150
<b>They'll charge their flank together with my main force!</b>

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.740
<b>The sixth division will stand their ground!</b>

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:03.700
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:16.630
<b>They've got monstrous mobility and penetrating power,</b>

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:19.340
<b>but as long as we don't take them head-on, we'll be fine.</b>

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:27.760
<b>The enemy's main force has no strength left.</b>

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:31.020
<b>We'll crush them along with the chivalric orders.</b>

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.640
<b>Three thousand enemy soldiers are coming from the northwest!</b>

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:36.060
<b>What? Again?!</b>

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:42.200
<b>Defend our people and our land against the invaders!</b>

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:45.070
<b>Follow after Tigrevurmud Vorn!</b>

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:48.580
<b>The sixth division has ground to a halt!</b>

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:50.410
<b>The enemy's gaining momentum!</b>

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:54.750
<b><i>Our reconnaissance units were thorough.</i></b>

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.340
<b><i>Where are all those reinforcements coming from?</i></b>

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:03.400
<b><i>Is this the power of a just cause that the war maiden talked about?</i></b>

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.890
<b>We're not done yet.</b>

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:11.220
<b>Our objective is to conquer southern Brune.</b>

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:14.230
<b>Order all units to retreat!</b>

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:21.230
<b>Kureys orders all of his men to
fall back and join into one unit.</b>

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:24.650
<b>Over six thousand soldiers died this day.</b>

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:33.870
<b>Between the advance party and the main force, we've lost over thirty percent of our men.</b>

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.120
<b>Well, it happens.</b>

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:39.630
<b>Kureys was waiting for specific intelligence.</b>

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:45.970
<b>A report that would determine his new course of action was just about to arrive.</b>

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:52.470
<b>The fleet left behind to attack Brune's 
southern harbor was sunk by Duke Thenardier.</b>

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:55.480
<b>Hm, I see...</b>

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.890
<b>To sum up,</b>

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:59.080
<b>I must defeat the enemy here</b>

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:01.150
<b>as well as Duke Thenardier,</b>

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:06.950
<b>and then secure both the southland and the port town, 
all with the thirty thousand men left to me.</b>

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.360
<b>That's a tall order!</b>

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:14.830
<b>We're withdrawing.</b>

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:15.870
<b>Withdrawing?!</b>

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:19.080
<b>I won't be caught holding the short end of the stick.</b>

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:24.090
<b>As long as I can shift the blame, I'll be fine.</b>

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:24.880
<b>I don't care!</b>

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.510
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.050
<b>Ah, let's see.</b>

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:34.140
<b>I still have to take a look at the 
enemy commander, Tigrevurmud Vorn.</b>

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:37.390
<b>I think I'll lay it on extra-thick when singing his praises.</b>

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:40.940
<b>I'll make sure even his enemies will envy him.</b>

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:44.150
<b>I've got it. This is what I'll say:</b>

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:49.820
<b>Though the Black Knight Roland may have perished, here's a hero to rival and surpass him!</b>

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:53.030
<b>Brune still has plenty of strength left!</b>

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.370
<b>Saying that should help me save face.</b>

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.040
<b>All right!</b>

00:14:56.580 --> 00:15:01.680
<b>We sincerely express our respect for a well-fought battle.</b>

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:03.540
<b>Your wisdom in uniting 
noblemen and knights, as well as</b>

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:05.300
<b>your valor in defending your people know no bounds.</b>

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:09.470
<b>Ah, to sing of your skill with the bow!</b>

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:13.050
<b>You rose above the heads of the soldiers blanketing the battlefield</b>

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.350
<b>to strike unerringly at your target,</b>

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:19.600
<b>like the heroes of legend known throughout our land.</b>

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:19.600
<b>Kureys sent an envoy to butter up Tigre,</b>

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:24.310
<b>bestowing upon him the honorable name Silvrash, 
one able to shoot even meteors.</b>

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:28.430
<b>It was a complete victory for the Silver Meteor Stormtroops.</b>

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:31.240
<b>Did we really win?</b>

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.870
<b>Given how swiftly they're retreating, it's not a trap.</b>

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.450
<b>You've won.</b>

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.410
<b>Okay...</b>

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.500
<b>H-Hey, what the...?!</b>

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.870
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.670
<b>You've been fighting a long time, huh?</b>

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:52.630
<b>That was a true display of your mettle.</b>

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:55.260
<b>It was quite beautiful, Tigre.</b>

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:03.270
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud, we must discuss what to...</b>

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.530
<b>Sleep tight.</b>

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.350
<b>I've returned, Tigre!</b>

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.560
<b>Amazing! Well done!</b>

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:50.150
<b>My, you're back early,</b>

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.320
<b>Eleonora.</b>

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:55.070
<b>What do you think you're doing?</b>

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.200
<b>Whatever do you mean?</b>

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:00.910
<b>Elen?</b>

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:15.720
<b>Come on! Hurry up and finish your fancy math, Bruneman!</b>

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:18.050
<b>If you're unable to use your head,</b>

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:20.560
<b>you should do twice the monkey-work to make up for it,</b>

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:21.720
<b>Zhctedian.</b>

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:24.730
<b>Here you go.</b>

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:26.270
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.060
<b>Titta, you can finish up here.</b>

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.070
<b>Go see the young lord.</b>

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:32.730
<b>I've already met with him.</b>

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:35.990
<b>He seemed to have his hands full with so many guests,</b>

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.570
<b>so I'm doing whatever I can to help.</b>

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.120
<b>That so?</b>

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:44.000
<b>You see, Count Tigre helped all these people.</b>

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:47.170
<b>The young lord is becoming a great man, isn't he?</b>

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:48.790
<b>Yes!</b>

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.920
<b>I sincerely apologize for my recent absence.</b>

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.680
<b>You don't have to. It was unavoidable.</b>

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:00.570
<b>Anyway, others have begun to see Tigre's undertaking as a just cause.</b>

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:02.930
<b>This in itself is a great victory.</b>

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.850
<b>Tigre and Roland...</b>

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:09.600
<b>The resolve of the living and the word of the dead</b>

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.190
<b>are what drew people here.</b>

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.570
<b>I merely helped things along a bit.</b>

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:18.610
<b>When I first met him, I thought he was merely a happy-go-lucky boy,</b>

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.950
<b>but now...</b>

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:23.950
<b>Now he's the third major power within Brune.</b>

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.960
<b>Well now, what will Tigre do next?</b>

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.130
<b>Now, if you'll excuse me...</b>

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.340
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:36.720
<b>Tigre,</b>

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:38.550
<b>come back to my tent.</b>

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:41.390
<b>I'll make you some delicious tea to invigorate you.</b>

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.310
<b>Why are <i>you</i> calling him "Tigre"?!</b>

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:49.190
<b>Tigre, why don't you start calling me Mila?</b>

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:50.600
<b>M-Mila?</b>

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.650
<b>Unfortunately for you,</b>

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:56.030
<b>Tigre and I have something to talk about.</b>

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:56.860
<b>Let's go.</b>

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:57.440
<b>Huh?</b>

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:03.240
<b>What could a woman who wasn't at his side when he really needed her possibly say to him?!</b>

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.620
<b>You're one to talk!</b>

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:08.410
<b>I bet you waited for the right moment to help
 so you could ask for the highest possible price!</b>

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.920
<b>It's not as though <i>you</i> are helping him for free, either!</b>

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:14.670
<b>But <i>I</i> have never tried to jack up my prices.</b>

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.330
<b>Unlike a certain someone.</b>

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.170
<b>Why, you...</b>

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:18.510
<b>Lady Ludmila,</b>

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.260
<b>we need your advice regarding how we manage supplies.</b>

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.680
<b>All right!</b>

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:23.850
<b>I'll be right there!</b>

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:24.760
<b>Y-Yes, ma'am.</b>

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:34.740
<b>Look, um...</b>

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.780
<b>Thank you for the invitation, Mila.</b>

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:40.700
<b>If it's fine with you,</b>

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:42.570
<b>why don't we meet up another time?</b>

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.300
<b>Mm, this is good.</b>

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.470
<b>Glad to hear it.</b>

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:05.640
<b>Is your friend all right?</b>

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:07.310
<b>Yeah, she's fine.</b>

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:08.930
<b>But what about you?</b>

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:12.850
<b>You shouldn't let yourself get seduced or let your eyes wander like that.</b>

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:18.110
<b>I'm kidding.</b>

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:22.530
<b>Ludmila did stand up to the Muozinellan army.</b>

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:24.110
<b>For your sake only.</b>

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:27.030
<b>You're every bit the man I thought you to be.</b>

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:33.750
<b>Elen...</b>

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:43.760
<b>I'm sorry for getting so many of your soldiers killed.</b>

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.790
<b>Lift up your head, Tigre.</b>

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:00.610
<b>Now lie down.</b>

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:27.890
<b>Do you regret the battles you fought up to now?</b>

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:34.430
<b>No, I don't.</b>

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:35.890
<b>Then that's enough.</b>

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:40.230
<b>Now pray to the god you
believe in on behalf of those</b>

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.570
<b>who fought and died so courageously.</b>

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:44.570
<b>All right.</b>

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:47.130
<b>Thank you.</b>

